+      "assetManifestPath must NOT appear as an asset row. A row whose path equals it refuses MANIFEST_SELF_LISTED, so the self-referential digest can never arise.",
+      "Completeness reads: every regular file under assetRoot, EXCEPT exactly the one path assetManifestPath, must appear as an asset row; any other unlisted regular file refuses EXTRA_UNLISTED_FILE.",
